. It will be around 4-8 hours of playtime depending on your run and there's plenty of builds and secrets to find so plenty of reasons to replay!Lastly there seems to be a bug with antivirus giving a false positive. This has happened t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028194","verified_at":"2026-10-21T14:30:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4989280-1846651706673322","game_id":"steam-4989280","kind":"announcement","title":"Gearing up for Steam Next Fest October and Release on 3rd of November!","summary":"Today I got the 3 week notice from Steam regarding the release of my game and I can say for sure that I am very much hyped! The Demo has been out since this summer and has had many bug fixes which can only be revealed with proper player testing. Numerous people have also helped me with the released version of my game to iron out every problem that might apear, but knowing game dev, there is bound to be something that breaks on release. Light Source has had much love put into it. I love drawing s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T06:41:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673322","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4989280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4989280":"2026-10-26T16:00:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4989280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:45Z"},"5025150":{"last_attempt_a